              "The exact analysis this document describes. Regenerating after a source change produces a different revision."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block": "subheading",
          "number": "1.2",
          "title": "Modelling Basis"
        },
        {
          "block": "prose",
          "text": "The structure of this document follows the information content of an IEEE 1016 software design description and the viewpoint structure of ISO/IEC/IEEE 42010. Interaction diagrams use UML sequence notation. The structure is a reference template; it does not claim certification to those standards."
        },
        {
          "block": "subheading",
          "number": "1.3",
          "title": "Design Principles"
        },
        {
          "block": "prose",
          "text": "- The `app` and `bsp` modules are separated into application and board-support layers.\n- The `interfaces` module and `platforms/stm32` module separate the board-I/O interface from its STM32 platform implementation.\n- The `configs` module keeps configuration files separate from the application and platform modules."
        },
